cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when using the Lean formalization or its certificates."
title: "A proof of Sharipov's second cuboid conjecture, with a complete Lean formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kuznetsov
    given-names: Vladislav
repository-code: "https://github.com/AnanasClassic/cuboid-2"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the irreducibility of Sharipov's second cuboid
  polynomial for distinct coprime positive integers p and q. The repository
  includes a mathematical manuscript, licensed separately under CC BY 4.0,
  and exact computational certificates.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - irreducible polynomials
  - Diophantine equations
version: "0.1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24410597"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-11-21"
